00:03:08.603 --> 00:03:13.200
Jennifer Coolidge's character Tanya, an alcoholic&nbsp;
grieving the recent death of her mother,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:18.240
instantly became a fan favorite. The actor's&nbsp;
performance in "The White Lotus" was so well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:22.440
received that it earned Coolidge her&nbsp;
first-ever Emmy Award in 2022. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:25.920
