00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:25.440
In Season 1 of "The White Lotus," Mark&nbsp;
discovers that his late father was gay.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:28.800
This is an interesting narrative&nbsp;
arc for Mark, but more than that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.040
